Protocol provenance
===================
Every parameter below is traced to (a) the primary paper and (b) the live reference implementation:
minno-tasks IAT/qualtrics/quiat9.js and scorer/nogaScorer.js (pinned commit in PROVENANCE.txt).
quiat9.js is what implicit.harvard.edu/implicit/takeatest.html serves: its instruction templates
match a transcript of the live Race IAT word for word, including the 28-trial block 5.
Full citations: references/papers.bib.  PDFs: references/fetch-papers.sh.

