Verification
------------
test/rescore.py        re-implements nogaScorer.js from its source; agrees with the C scorer to < 1e-3.
test/rescore_2003.py   re-implements 2003 Table 4 steps 1-9 (with PI's 400 ms floor); agrees for D_2003.
make test              runs both on every stimulus set, both frontends, at 100x speed.
Trial balance per category and key per block was checked from the CSV (10/10, 5/5, 14/14).
A scripted participant with no latency difference scores |D| < 0.1.
